<SCENARIO VER="105">
{PLAYSND "BGM死月編\鬱蒼.ogg" "BGM" "REPEAT" "1000" "0"}
{WAIT "2000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{CREATECG "000" "グラフィック\背景\詫言編　夢から\集会場.gal" "NORMAL" "#1" "R" "B" "0" "1" "3000" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{WAIT "1000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{MESON "500"}
{CREATECG "文字カウント画像" "グラフィック\システム\文字カウント画像.gal" "NORMAL" "#1" "C" "B" "0" "1" "0" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
<TXSPN>So this was the meeting hall where they had kept watch on <STYLE ID="1">Kotaro-san</STYLE>―
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
Unlike the old exterior, the inside had been cleaned spotless.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
At the front there was an altar.<PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{CREATECG "アイテム1" "グラフィック\立ち絵\アイテム\栄一郎遺影.gal" "NORMAL" "#1" "600" "C" "0" "1" "1000" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{WAIT "1000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{MESON "500"}
One of the things on it was <STYLE ID="2">Ojisan</STYLE>'s memorial photo, but everything else was stuff I had never seen.<PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{CHANGECG "000" "グラフィック\背景\詫言編　夢から\能面横から.gal" "NORMAL" "" "0" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{DELETECG "アイテム1" "1" "3000" "0" "0" "" "0"}
{WAIT "1000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{MESON "500"}
On a table-like stand, red robes the same as the ones we were wearing had been laid out, with a Noh mask placed at the head.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
{MESOFF "500"}
{CHANGECG "000" "グラフィック\背景\詫言編　夢から\能面上から.gal" "NORMAL" "1" "3000" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{WAIT "1000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{MESON "500"}
At first glance it looked like a person lying there, but the sleeves and hem dangled limply off the stand, and the body was completely flat.<PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{CHANGECG "000" "グラフィック\背景\詫言編　夢から\ナイフ突き立て.gal" "NORMAL" "1" "3000" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{WAIT "1000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{MESON "500"}
Next to the stand with the Noh mask and red robes, there was another stand just like it.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
Countless knives had been stabbed into the top of it, standing upright.<PG>
<STYLE ID="3">"</STYLE><STYLE ID="4">Haruka</STYLE><STYLE ID="3">, what's that?"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
{MESOFF "500"}
{CHANGECG "000" "グラフィック\背景\詫言編　夢から\集会場.gal" "NORMAL" "" "0" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{CREATECG "人物1" "グラフィック\立ち絵\人物\死神\死神春花バストアップ.gal" "NORMAL" "#1" "R" "B" "0" "1" "500" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{MESON "500"}
<STYLE ID="4">"For now, just sit anywhere."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
As <STYLE ID="4">Haruka</STYLE> urged, I sat kneeling on the tatami.<PG>
<STYLE ID="4">"Well, just copy everybody. </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="4">And no more chatting in here. The shinigami'll learn your voice."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
Okay, so keeping quiet during the service is probably the same as at a regular one.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
Instead of answering, I gave a big nod.<PG>
But the <STYLE ID="5" RUBY="つぼ">pot</STYLE> and tripod I had seen this morning weren't there.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
Those were supposed to show up as ritual implements too...<PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{STOPSND "BGM" "5000" "PASS"}
{DELETECG "000,人物1" "1" "3000" "0" "0" "" "0"}
{WAIT "1000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{CREATECG "人物1" "グラフィック\立ち絵\人物\死神\軍団.gal" "NORMAL" "#1" "C" "B" "0" "1" "3000" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{MESON "500"}
―By the time 10 o'clock came around, about 15 people had gathered in the meeting hall.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
It looked like everyone in the settlement had come.<PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{PLAYSND "太古の暗い鳴動.ogg" "BGM" "REPEAT" "1000" "0"}
{DELETECG "人物1" "1" "3000" "0" "0" "" "0"}
{WAIT "1000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{CHANGECG "000" "グラフィック\背景\詫言編　夢から\集会場.gal" "NORMAL" "" "0" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{CREATECG "人物1" "グラフィック\立ち絵\人物\死神\死神手ぶら.gal" "NORMAL" "#1" "R" "B" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{CREATECG "人物2" "グラフィック\立ち絵\人物\死神\死神手ぶら.gal" "NORMAL" "#1" "C" "B" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{CREATECG "人物3" "グラフィック\立ち絵\人物\詫言編　始まり以降\大魔女手ぶら.gal" "NORMAL" "#1" "470" "B" "100" "1" "3000" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{WAIT "1000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{MESON "500"}
Three people dressed the same as us came in through the front entrance.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
Then all the attendees, <STYLE ID="4">Haruka</STYLE> included, bowed low where they sat, as if prostrating themselves.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="6">Goto</STYLE> and I <STYLE ID="7" RUBY="なら">followed</STYLE> suit.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
Only one of them had a different mask and a different robe color.<PG>
That one must be <STYLE ID="8">Erika-chan</STYLE>, and the other two must be <STYLE ID="9">Obasan</STYLE> and <STYLE ID="10">Chiga-nee</STYLE>.<PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{CHANGECG "人物1" "グラフィック\立ち絵\アイテム\壺と三脚.gal" "NORMAL" "" "0" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{CHANGECG "人物2" "グラフィック\立ち絵\アイテム\フラスコ.gal" "NORMAL" "" "0" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{DELETECG "人物3,000" "1" "3000" "0" "0" "" "0"}
{WAIT "1000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{MESON "500"}
The Grand Witch was holding a flask of clear liquid. One witch held the pot, and the other held the tripod.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
There was no doubt those were the things carried up from underground this morning.<PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{CREATECG "000" "グラフィック\背景\スチル\壺幻影.gal" "NORMAL" "#1" "R" "B" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{DELETECG "人物2,人物1" "1" "3000" "0" "0" "" "0"}
{WAIT "1000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{MESON "500"}
Then the tripod with the <STYLE ID="5" RUBY="つぼ">pot</STYLE> on it was set in front of the memorial photo, and the <STYLE ID="8">Grand Witch</STYLE> lit a fire.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
With that done, the three witches knelt in front of the memorial photo.<PG>
............
{PAUSE ""}
............ 
{PAUSE ""}
But no matter how many minutes passed, nothing moved at all.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="3">"</STYLE><STYLE ID="4">Haruka</STYLE><STYLE ID="3">, this is..."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="4">"Quiet. Just a little longer."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="3">"............"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
Kneeling like this, which I rarely do, made my legs feel cramped.<PG>
―Eventually, the smell of oil began to fill the room.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
The smell was drifting from that <STYLE ID="5" RUBY="つぼ">pot</STYLE>.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
I knew this smell.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
It was a lot like the fried giant bullfrog I had eaten yesterday.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
So was that giant bullfrog oil in there?<PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{PLAYSND "SE\詫言編　夢から\壺着火.ogg" "VOICE" "NORMAL" "1000" "0"}
{CREATECG "111" "$800000" "NORMAL" "#1" "C" "B" "100" "1" "100" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{CREATECG "000" "グラフィック\背景\スチル\壺点火.gal" "NORMAL" "#1" "C" "B" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{DELETECG "111" "1" "1000" "0" "0" "" "0"}
{WAIT "1000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{MESON "500"}
Blue flames rose from the <STYLE ID="5" RUBY="つぼ">pot</STYLE>.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
It seemed the oil had reached its flash point.<PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{CREATECG "人物1" "グラフィック\立ち絵\人物\詫言編　始まり以降\大魔女手ぶら.gal" "NORMAL" "#1" "C" "B" "0" "1" "1000" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{MESON "500"}
Then the <STYLE ID="8">Grand Witch</STYLE> stood up.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="8">"A morte chegou. Todo mundo vai Shibaro o Grim Reaper."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
Was it some kind of incantation? The pronunciation clearly wasn't Japanese, either.<PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{CREATECG "アイテム1" "グラフィック\立ち絵\アイテム\フラスコ.gal" "NORMAL" "#1" "650" "C" "100" "1" "1000" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{MESON "500"}
Then the <STYLE ID="8">Grand Witch</STYLE> let a little from the flask in her hand drip into the flaming pot.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
{MESOFF "500"}
{PLAYSND "SE\詫言編　夢から\壺着火大.ogg" "VOICE" "NORMAL" "1000" "0"}
{CREATECG "111" "$800000" "NORMAL" "#1" "C" "B" "100" "1" "100" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{DELETECG "111" "1" "2000" "0" "0" "" "0"}
{WAIT "1000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{MESON "500"}
For an instant, the fire blazed up so high it nearly reached the ceiling.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
But in less than a second, it went back to its original size.<PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{CHANGECG "人物1" "グラフィック\立ち絵\人物\死神\死神手ぶら.gal" "NORMAL" "" "0" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{CREATECG "人物2" "グラフィック\立ち絵\人物\死神\死神手ぶら.gal" "NORMAL" "#1" "100" "B" "0" "1" "1000" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{MESON "500"}
Next, the two witches stood up.<PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{CHANGECG "000" "グラフィック\背景\詫言編　夢から\ナイフ突き立て.gal" "NORMAL" "" "0" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{DELETECG "人物1,アイテム1,人物2" "1" "3000" "0" "0" "" "0"}
{WAIT "1000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{MESON "500"}
They each pulled out one of the knives stuck in the table, 
{PAUSE ""}
{MESOFF "500"}
{CREATECG "人物1" "グラフィック\立ち絵\人物\詫言編　始まり以降\ナイフ突き立て.gal" "NORMAL" "#1" "R" "T" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{DELETECG "000" "1" "3000" "0" "0" "" "0"}
{WAIT "1000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{MESON "500"}
rolled up their sleeves just a little, and lightly stabbed their arms.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
And then, 
{PAUSE ""}
{MESOFF "500"}
{PLAYSND "SE\詫言編　夢から\ナイフ突き立て.ogg" "VOICE" "NORMAL" "1000" "0"}
<EVENT VALUE="MOTION\r\n789\r\n人物1\r\n4\r\n540\r\n200\r\nNORMAL\r\nPASS">
{WAITPLAY "VOICE" "CLICK"}
{PLAYSND "SE\詫言編　夢から\ナイフ突き立て.ogg" "VOICE" "NORMAL" "1000" "0"}
{WAITPLAY "VOICE" "CLICK"}
{CREATECG "000" "グラフィック\背景\詫言編　夢から\能面ナイフ横から.gal" "NORMAL" "#1" "C" "B" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{DELETECG "人物1" "1" "3000" "0" "0" "" "0"}
{WAIT "1000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{MESON "500"}
they plunged the knives into the red robes spread out on the other table in one stroke.<PG>
Next, they took the flask in turn 
{PAUSE ""}
{MESOFF "500"}
{PLAYSND "SE\詫言編　夢から\壺着火大.ogg" "VOICE" "NORMAL" "1000" "0"}
{CREATECG "111" "$800000" "NORMAL" "#1" "C" "B" "100" "1" "100" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{DELETECG "111" "1" "2000" "0" "0" "" "0"}
{PLAYSND "SE\詫言編　夢から\壺着火大.ogg" "VOICE" "NORMAL" "1000" "0"}
{CREATECG "111" "$800000" "NORMAL" "#1" "C" "B" "100" "1" "100" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{DELETECG "111" "1" "2000" "0" "0" "" "0"}
{MESON "500"}
and let a little of the liquid drip into the <STYLE ID="5" RUBY="つぼ">pot</STYLE>.<PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{CHANGECG "000" "グラフィック\背景\詫言編　夢から\集会場.gal" "NORMAL" "" "0" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{CREATECG "人物1" "グラフィック\立ち絵\人物\死神\死神春花バストアップ.gal" "NORMAL" "#1" "R" "B" "0" "1" "1000" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{MESON "500"}
<STYLE ID="4">"</STYLE><STYLE ID="3">Natsumi</STYLE><STYLE ID="4">, </STYLE><STYLE ID="6">Goto</STYLE><STYLE ID="4">, let's go. You can stab the knives anywhere except the head."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
{MESOFF "500"}
{DELETECG "000,人物1" "1" "500" "0" "0" "" "0"}
{MESON "500"}
With that, <STYLE ID="4">Haruka</STYLE> stood up.<PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{CHANGECG "000" "グラフィック\背景\詫言編　夢から\ナイフ突き立て.gal" "NORMAL" "" "0" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{MESON "500"}
<STYLE ID="4">Haruka</STYLE> pulled out one of the knives,
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="4">"Hss..."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="4">Haruka</STYLE> drew the knife smoothly across her own arm.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
Blood began to seep faintly from the cut.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
She pulled out one more knife 
{PAUSE ""}
{MESOFF "500"}
{PLAYSND "SE\詫言編　夢から\ナイフ突き立て.ogg" "VOICE" "NORMAL" "1000" "0"}
{WAITPLAY "VOICE" "CLICK"}
{PLAYSND "SE\詫言編　夢から\ナイフ突き立て.ogg" "VOICE" "NORMAL" "1000" "0"}
{WAITPLAY "VOICE" "CLICK"}
{MESON "500"}
and stabbed both into the robes on the stand.<PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{DELETECG "000" "1" "500" "0" "0" "" "0"}
{MESON "500"}
Then, 
{PAUSE ""}
{MESOFF "500"}
{PLAYSND "SE\詫言編　夢から\壺着火大.ogg" "VOICE" "NORMAL" "1000" "0"}
{CREATECG "111" "$800000" "NORMAL" "#1" "C" "B" "100" "1" "100" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{DELETECG "111" "1" "2000" "0" "0" "" "0"}
{MESON "500"}
<STYLE ID="4">Haruka</STYLE> picked up the flask set beside it and let a few drops of the liquid fall into the pot.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
It seemed I just had to copy this.<PG>
Shirozaki-san had said this <STYLE ID="5" RUBY="つぼ">pot</STYLE> was used something like offering incense. Was this what he meant?<PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{CHANGECG "000" "グラフィック\背景\詫言編　夢から\集会場.gal" "NORMAL" "1" "500" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{MESON "500"}
Even so, cutting your own arm with a knife...
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
When I glanced behind me, a line had formed of people waiting their turn.<PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{CHANGECG "000" "グラフィック\背景\詫言編　夢から\ナイフ突き立て.gal" "NORMAL" "1" "1000" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{MESON "500"}
If I dawdled, I would be holding everyone up...
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
I made up my mind and pulled out a knife before the fear could weigh down on me.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
Then I rolled up my sleeve just a little and pressed the tip of the blade into my arm.<PG>
<STYLE ID="3">"Ngh..."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
It was my first time doing anything like self-harm, but it seemed the blade hadn't gone in as deep as I had thought.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
All it did was make a little blood seep from the cut.<PG>
Then I pulled out another knife and stabbed it into the arm of the robes on the stand.
{PLAYSND "SE\詫言編　夢から\ナイフ突き立て.ogg" "VOICE" "NORMAL" "1000" "0"}
{WAITPLAY "VOICE" "CLICK"}
{PLAYSND "SE\詫言編　夢から\ナイフ突き立て.ogg" "VOICE" "NORMAL" "1000" "0"}
{WAITPLAY "VOICE" "CLICK"}
<PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
