Next was the liquid in the flask.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
This was a little dangerous too. If I messed up, I would get burned.<PG>
Inside the <STYLE ID="5" RUBY="つぼ">pot</STYLE>, something like oil was boiling, with flames rising off it.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
When I picked up the flask and let a little of the liquid drip in,
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
