{MESON "500"}
<STYLE ID="3">"Hot...!"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
a big flame shot up for an instant and hit me square in the face.<PG>
I let out a small scream, but neither <STYLE ID="4">Haruka</STYLE> nor anyone else reacted.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
But thanks to the Noh mask and hood, it didn't turn into anything serious.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
But... what was this smell?<PG>
The moment I dripped the liquid in, an odor I had never smelled before rose up.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
My head was spinning, or rather, my brain picked up a strange sensation.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
What on earth was the liquid in this flask...<PG>
Once <STYLE ID="6">Goto</STYLE> had gone through the ritual the same way, we went straight back to where we had been sitting.<PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{CHANGECG "000" "グラフィック\背景\詫言編　夢から\集会場.gal" "NORMAL" "" "0" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
