{MESON "500"}
<STYLE ID="4">"Nice, you two. Perfect."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="4">Haruka</STYLE> praised us in a whisper.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
{STOPSND "BGM" "5000" "PASS"}
But ever since I had smelled that liquid, something was off with my body.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
I was heating up from the inside and couldn't settle down.<PG>
Come to think of it, <STYLE ID="2">Ojisan</STYLE> had used that to make Droga, according to <STYLE ID="6">Goto</STYLE>'s guess.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
If so, then what was in that flask... it couldn't be...<PG>
