The red robes weren't light, either. They weighed heavily on my shoulders.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
We headed home in silence.<PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{CHANGECG "000" "グラフィック\背景\詫言編　夢から\新村本家昼.gal" "NORMAL" "" "0" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{DELETECG "人物1" "1" "3000" "0" "0" "" "0"}
{WAIT "1000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{MESON "500"}
When I looked at the cut on my arm, it seemed light enough not to need any treatment.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
Partly because of the wooden sandals and how tired we were, it took a whole 15 minutes to get from the meeting hall to the house.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="15">Kana-chan</STYLE> and <STYLE ID="1">Kotaro-san</STYLE> were probably already inside.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
Weren't <STYLE ID="8">Erika-chan</STYLE> and the others back yet?<PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{PLAYSND "SE\詫言編　夢から\引き戸.ogg" "VOICE" "NORMAL" "1000" "0"}
{DELETECG "000" "1" "3000" "0" "0" "" "0"}
{CREATECG "000" "グラフィック\背景\詫言編　夢から\新村本家玄関.gal" "NORMAL" "#1" "C" "B" "0" "1" "3000" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{WAIT "1000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{CREATECG "人物1" "グラフィック\立ち絵\人物\五島バストアップ.gal" "NORMAL" "#1" "R" "B" "0" "1" "500" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{MESON "500"}
<STYLE ID="6">"Ahh, geez, that was rough..."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
Once we got home, <STYLE ID="6">Goto</STYLE> promptly took off her red robes and Noh mask.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="3">"That really was a strange memorial service. Cutting our arms with knives..."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
{MESOFF "500"}
{CREATECG "人物2" "グラフィック\立ち絵\人物\死神\死神春花バストアップ.gal" "NORMAL" "#1" "L" "B" "0" "1" "500" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{MESON "500"}
<STYLE ID="4">"That's the only kind I know. </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="4">Sorry, I should've told you about the arm-cutting and stuff."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="3">"Well, it's not like it's a big cut."</STYLE><PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{PLAYSND "SE\詫言編　夢から\引き戸.ogg" "VOICE" "NORMAL" "1000" "0"}
{CHANGECG "人物1" "グラフィック\立ち絵\人物\死神\死神手ぶらバストアップ.gal" "NORMAL" "" "0" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{DELETECG "人物2" "1" "3000" "0" "0" "" "0"}
{WAIT "1000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{MESON "500"}
Just then, someone came into the house.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
{MESOFF "500"}
{PLAYSND "SE\swish.ogg" "VOICE" "NORMAL" "1000" "0"}
{CHANGECG "人物1" "グラフィック\立ち絵\人物\詫言編　始まり以降\茅萱死神バストアップ.gal" "NORMAL" "1" "3000" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{MESON "500"}
<STYLE ID="10">"Mm... </STYLE><STYLE ID="6">Goto-chan</STYLE><STYLE ID="10"> and </STYLE><STYLE ID="3">Natsumi-chan</STYLE><STYLE ID="10">, were you all right?</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="10">　Looks like you breathed the falsificaso in directly..."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
From under the Noh mask appeared <STYLE ID="10">Chiga-nee</STYLE>'s slightly sweaty face.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="3">"Yeah, I'm okay, but honestly, none of it was anything I'd ever seen before. </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="3">Ahh, I'm tired."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
I sprawled out spread-eagled in the entryway.<PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{CREATECG "人物2" "グラフィック\立ち絵\人物\死神\死神春花バストアップ.gal" "NORMAL" "#1" "L" "B" "0" "1" "500" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{MESON "500"}
<STYLE ID="4">"</STYLE><STYLE ID="10">Chiga-nee</STYLE><STYLE ID="4">, good work on your debut as a witch."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="10">"Mm... it's more nerve-racking than I thought it would be. </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="10">But maybe I did pretty well for a first time. </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="10">There's still time before lunch, so you should all rest in your room for a bit."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="4">"Yeah, let's do that."</STYLE><PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{DELETECG "000,人物1,人物2" "1" "3000" "0" "0" "" "0"}
{MESON "500"}
As <STYLE ID="4">Haruka</STYLE> and <STYLE ID="10">Chiga-nee</STYLE> urged, we headed to the room on the second floor.<PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{CREATECG "000" "グラフィック\背景\詫言編　夢から\新村本家2階.gal" "NORMAL" "#1" "C" "B" "0" "1" "3000" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{WAIT "1000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{MESON "500"}
As soon as we got to the room, all three of us flopped down on the tatami.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
{MESOFF "500"}
{CREATECG "人物1" "グラフィック\立ち絵\人物\春花頭かく.gal" "NORMAL" "#1" "R" "B" "0" "1" "500" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{MESON "500"}
<STYLE ID="4">"Whew, but doing it again after so long really does wear you out."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
It seemed <STYLE ID="4">Haruka</STYLE> had had a hard time of it too.<PG>
<STYLE ID="3">"Anyway, what do the knives and all that mean? Is that really an offering for the dead?"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
{MESOFF "500"}
{CHANGECG "人物1" "グラフィック\立ち絵\人物\春花腰に手1バストアップ.gal" "NORMAL" "1" "500" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{MESON "500"}
<STYLE ID="4">"I told you earlier, right? The dead are shinigami, and they try to take us away. </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="4">So they make the shinigami possess the red robes and Noh mask laid on the stand, pin it with the knives so it can't move, and then finish it off like that, apparently."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="3">"And cutting our arms?"</STYLE><PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{CHANGECG "人物1" "グラフィック\立ち絵\人物\春花頭かく.gal" "NORMAL" "1" "500" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{MESON "500"}
<STYLE ID="4">"Hmm, what's that about? Maybe our blood can defeat the shinigami or something?"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
{MESOFF "500"}
{CREATECG "人物2" "グラフィック\立ち絵\人物\五島考えるバストアップ.gal" "NORMAL" "#1" "L" "B" "0" "1" "500" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{MESON "500"}
<STYLE ID="6">"This is less an offering for the dead and more like exorcising a demon..."</STYLE><PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{CHANGECG "人物1" "グラフィック\立ち絵\人物\春花腰に手1バストアップ.gal" "NORMAL" "1" "500" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{MESON "500"}
<STYLE ID="4">"Well, I don't really get it either. That's supposedly the traditional memorial service of the Arata settlement. </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="4">It started out as a gathering of outcasts. I don't think it's that weird that they have strange rituals."</STYLE><PG>
A pleasant breeze blew in through the open window.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
It cooled my sweaty body just right.<PG>
<STYLE ID="6">"</STYLE><STYLE ID="3">Kogori-senpai</STYLE><STYLE ID="6">, how long are you going to keep that on? Just looking at it makes me feel hot..."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
I still had the red robes on. I'd better take them off.<PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{PLAYSND "SE\swish.ogg" "VOICE" "NORMAL" "1000" "0"}
