<STYLE ID="6">"RUNNOW... </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="6">And it's written in blood."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
If someone put the paper in, then it was someone other than me who had a chance to touch these red robes―<PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{CHANGECG "人物2" "グラフィック\立ち絵\人物\詫言編　始まり以降\城崎バストアップ.gal" "NORMAL" "" "0" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{DELETECG "000,人物1" "1" "3000" "0" "0" "" "0"}
